<title>UK: Credit Suisse warrants on Thailand equity basket.</title>
<headline>Credit Suisse warrants on Thailand equity basket.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Suisse says it has issued 50,000 American-style call warrants, on a Thailand Equity basket comprising 20 Thai companies.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    900.00 THB		PREMIUM	19.48 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     5.48 USD		  GEARING	6.24 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 29.OCT.96-26.FEB.98   PAYDATE	28.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   NONE			MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
